        <span class="eyebrow">Best Answer Hub Playbooks · Start Here</span>
        <h1>Where Should Your Small Business <em>Start With AI?</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain-English first-step guide for owners of small and medium businesses. How to find your first AI task, pick one tool, test it in 30 days, and ignore the noise, before spending a penny on anything bigger.</p>
        <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~8 min read</span><span>Vendor-neutral</span><span>No signup</span></div>
