          <div class="seg s1">1 · Find the task<small>biggest weekly time drain</small></div>
          <div class="seg s2">2 · Pick one tool<small>free or low-cost</small></div>
          <div class="seg s3">3 · Test 30 days<small>measure the result</small></div>
          <div class="seg s4">4 · Keep or drop<small>then repeat</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

